wh shr a2 7
wl and a2 127
wh1 add wh 1
w0 get args wh
w1 get args wh1
win arr w0 w1
s0 rec win wl esc
s fold txtb cnt s0 slo shi so
w at s 0
f at s 1
esc2 at s 2
v0 get w 0
v1 get w 1
args1 set args wh v0
in1 lt wh1 256
o1 get args1 wh1
x1 select in1 v1 o1
args2 set args1 wh1 x1
added sub f wl
pairs shr added 1
na2 add na pairs
r rec args2 na2 esc2
ret r
end
